>On 10/22/10 17:54, Gene Heskett wrote:
>> On Friday, October 22, 2010, Randy Dunlap wrote:
>>> On 10/22/10 13:08, Gene Heskett wrote:
>>>> On Friday, October 22, 2010, Randy Dunlap wrote:
